{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories: Brenton Lake is a psychological thriller horror game that combines real-life stories with its own unique narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong><u>Dark Memories: Brenton Lake</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an adventure enthusiast, you've rented an old lookout near Brenton Lake to spend the weekend. You also rented a boat to better enjoy fishing on the lake. What starts as a peaceful area becomes unsettling with an approaching blizzard, turning into a struggle with an unknown outcome.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.poster.avif?t=1752473009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.webm?t=1752473009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/d4a526538c6e7987e78c9f7e3576e485.mp4?t=1752473009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a first-person walking simulator, enriched with exploration, fishing, various interactions, and dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.poster.avif?t=1752473009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.webm?t=1752473009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5fa772c6990710e34ed822847a10676a.mp4?t=1752473009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Realistic, atmospheric environment accompanied by retro effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fishing mechanic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Interactive NPCs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5ed5d1b1caf5eaec2dadf8a3d90bf5c4.poster.avif?t=1752473009\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/extras/5ed5d1b1caf5eaec2dadf8a3d90bf5c4.webm?t=1752473009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2825740?t=1752473009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/b48d61c0311d212cec630d3f028b1d40b5f44e64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752473009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/40b4b1a23134e156ed125854f65696995a55da58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752473009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825740/40b4b1a23134e156ed125854f65696995a55da58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752473009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features objects stained with blood and includes dialogue that contains strong language and profanity, which are integral to the narrative and ambiance of the investigative experience."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the Game</u></strong></h